<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$115.1 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$115.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The strong flow of Australian promissory notes that opened the week continued on Tuesday, although the number of issuers halved.</p>
<p>Graham &amp; Co's A$15.1 million issue was dwarfed by Lend Lease Corp's A$100 million sale of mid-May notes which went at one to three basis points over BBSW.</p>
<p>Of the A$100 million Lend Lease notes sold, A$55 million settled today while the balance settles on Wednesday.</p>
